WEBVTT

00:00:58.847 --> 00:01:01.466
provinces and others
are joining that movement.

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:04.403
And when we succeed --
and it will take all of us --

00:01:04.427 --> 00:01:06.663
we will change the course
of human history.

00:01:07.894 --> 00:01:10.124
What do I mean by violence
against children?

00:01:10.498 --> 00:01:12.475
I mean all of the physical violence,

00:01:12.499 --> 00:01:15.450
sexual, psychological
and emotional violence

00:01:15.474 --> 00:01:17.577
that happens to children at home,

00:01:17.601 --> 00:01:21.243
at school, online
and in their communities.

00:01:22.141 --> 00:01:24.203
We work with partners
right across the world

00:01:24.227 --> 00:01:26.608
and from those partners,
we hear disturbing stories

00:01:26.632 --> 00:01:28.165
of individual children.

00:01:28.736 --> 00:01:31.899
For example, Sarah, age 10.